OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 10, has swum in the sea
OL,4,Aevery day for a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany of us will have spent the hot
OL,7,Fsummer cooling off at the coast, but
OL,8,Fone 10-year-old girl has been in the
OL,9,Fsea every day this year in a quest to
OL,10,Fraise money for charity.
OL,12,FClara, from Southwold in Suffolk, has
OL,13,Fcollected more than #5,600 towards her
OL,14,F#6,000 target for the RNLI.
OL,16,F"I've had days when there are massive
OL,17,Fstorms and I really sometimes didn't
OL,18,Fwant to do it because even just
OL,19,Fstepping out of the warm into the rain
OL,20,Fand rushing wind, wrapped in a towel
OL,21,Fand a swimming costume, is kind of
OL,22,Fhard," she said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
