OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 10, has swum in the sea
OL,4,Aevery day for a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer dad, Nathan, an RNLI volunteer,
OL,7,Fsaid the challenge was all Clara's idea
OL,8,Fand "that is what makes us particularly
OL,9,Fproud".
